      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: Yeah that's understandable I was mainly pointing it out as in your original post you mainly pointed out all the bad things about G3D and all the good things about Z3D when it comes to performance which in fairness is true but there's also a bit of a sacrifice to quality that should be mentioned.",
